# GEO-092 I19:副支端面頂 RC(外輪廓邊)→ V_CUT_PRIORITY
# 副支沿 u(垂直主支軸 v),兩端落在 e1/e3 直立外輪廓邊上,
# 該處沒有邊界主支可當擋面 → 端面頂 RC → 拒絕
surface 1 origin 0 0 2500 u +x v +y outline 0,0 4000,0 4000,3000 0,3000
grid 1 on 1 v 1500
timber 1 20 20 role boundary
timber 2 27 33 role secondary
place 1 on 1 at-face e0 +u +n
place 2 on 1 at-line grid 1 v 0 +u +n
